"""HyprComp Overview — GTK4 fullscreen workspace overview overlay.

Shows a 2D grid of all projects (rows) and workspaces (columns) with
screenshot thumbnails for the active workspace and synthetic previews
for occupied workspaces.

Keys: click=switch, d=close windows, a=new workspace, q/Esc=quit.
"""

